SUMMARY:Appalachian Healing Collective Gathering: Give & Receive!
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nAre you tantalized by different healing m
 odalities? Do you thrive on community magic?\n\nJoin us for an opportunity
  to give of your gifts along with a group to another\, and then receive th
 e menagerie offered you! Practice asking for what you want and need and tr
 usting that the collective efforts will heal/launch you into an never-befo
 re-felt-experience of group focus…on loving YOU!\n\nSome examples of pre
 vious offerings: reiki\, activations\, massage\, crystals and gem stone ma
 gic\, didgeridoo and other sound healing\, and oracle card draws. We have 
 some instruments that you are welcome to play such as crystal bowls\, drum
 s\, handpans\, rainsticks\, etc.\n\nOur event has been described by our co
 mmunity member Lauren as “Wow! Experimental play\, multi-sensory\, multi
 dimensional\, intuitive energy\, and sound magic healing.”\n\nSome fello
 wship with snacks afterwards. Bring some if you're inspired!\n\nMore detai
 ls [here](https://liminalyoga.com/ahc) including a note about [healer hier
 archy](https://liminalyoga.com/ahc/#healer-hierarchy) and why we are askin
 g a monetary exchange for this. $20-60\n\n[Register](https://docs.google.c
 om/forms/d/1JcMC2Ryl3RV2IZaMDbIGtTCdMrtAcEejjbnNhC20xvY/) to secure your s
 pot!
