SUMMARY:Community Yard Sale
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us for a **Community Yard Sale** on 
 Saturday\, June 20th from 8 a.m. to 2 p.m.\n\nAs Marian and Levi prepare t
 o transition out of their venues\, they’ll be offering a curated mix of 
 furniture\, crystals\, and other treasures from Energetic Experiences and 
 Moldavite Life. This is a rare chance to take home pieces that have been p
 art of the magic.\n\nWe’re also opening up the space for the community t
 o join in. Bring your car\, set up from your trunk\, and sell anything you
 ’re ready to pass along.\n\nWhether it’s home goods\, clothing\, tools
 \, or hidden gems\, all are welcome.\nCome browse\, connect\, and give new
  life to well-loved items.\nSpread the word and bring a friend.
