SUMMARY:HeArts in Bloom: Summer Solstice Celebration at Quietude
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nAfter the week long Art in Bloom celebrat
 ion of the union between art and nature\, Quietude will host a special Sum
 mer Solstice Celebration. Join David and Michelle on a journey designed to
  help integrate\, ground\, and embody the radiant energy of the longest da
 y of the year.\nHeArts in Bloom is a heart-centered celebration of renewal
 \, creativity\, and connection\, honoring the fullness of the sun and the 
 blossoming taking place both within and around us. Together\, we still our
 selves and share the warmth\, just as the sun does on the Summer Solstice.
  We shine and flow with the rhythms of nature\, creating a space for refle
 ction\, intention\, and transformation.\n\n**Our gathering will begin with
  connecting to the wisdom and intelligence of water**\; inviting clarity\,
  flow\, and emotional alignment as we attune to the abundant energy of the
  solstice season. **We will then co-create an earth mandala using flowers 
 and natural elements**\, weaving our collective prayers and intentions int
 o a living work of art.\nAn illuminating Astrology Report will explore how
  this year’s intense astrological configurations have challenged\, trans
 formed\, and prepared us for a new season of growth. After navigating powe
 rful cosmic shifts\, we are now being called to expand our HeARTS and reap
  what we have sown deep within ourselves\, trust where we are\, and bloom 
 where we’re planted.\n\nMercury will Retrograde June 29 in Cancer making
  this a divine window to integrate our past\n\n**Participants will be imme
 rsed in the restorative frequencies of a Solar Gong Sound Bath**\, offerin
 g an opportunity to release stagnant energy\, awaken vitality\, and integr
 ate the expansive energies of this powerful seasonal threshold.\nJoin us f
 or this soulful solstice celebration of art\, nature\, sound\, and spirit 
 as we honor the light of summer and the unfolding beauty of collective tra
 nsformation.\n\n**Price is a sliding scale $33-$55 Please give what you ca
 n**. You can register and pre-pay right here [StarSounds](https://www.star
 sounds.love/event-details/hearts-in-bloom-summer-solstice-celebration-at-q
 uietude) or at Vemno @starsounds. **If bringing cash or pay at the door\, 
 please email to reserve your spot**. If you are light on funds and want to
  attend\, please email David at [[david@starsounds.love](mailto:david@star
 sounds.love) for a summer special for you\n\n### **About Your Guides**\n\n
 **David Heiss** is an Evolutionary Astrologer\, Sound Alchemist & Sacred C
 eremony Facilitator who specializes in Self-Discovery. He helps reveal eac
 h person’s unique collection of stars and sound using a variety of insig
 htful chart readings\, sound journeys\, and immersive experiences. David b
 lends Gongs\, Crystal and Tibetan bowls\, plus many other mystical instrum
 ents to cultivate conditions for healing and restoration. [https://www.sta
 rsounds.love/](https://www.starsounds.love/)\n\n**Michelle** is an avid So
 ulCollage® Creatrix and lifelong educator who knows we are a network of c
 onnected humans. Michelle delights in nurturing and expanding ideas\, peop
 le\, and communities that are lighting up the world with their precious en
 ergy. She works with individual’s HighSelves\, offering a wide range of 
 tools and experiences\, to facilitate self-reflection and access to inner 
 wisdom. Learn more [www.autumnhair.net](http://www.autumnhair.net).
